OL,3,GNEWSAReducing pothole-fixing machine
OL,4,Afleet 'a concern'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe machines were part of a #22m
OL,7,Finvestment over two years to help
OL,8,Fimprove the speed and efficiency of
OL,9,Fpothole repairs across the region.
